    "description": "## Source of truth\n\nhttps://jumpr.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/JK/pages/269090817/03+User+Stories+Jira+Disposition\n\n## Outcome\n\nEach Sign-Up is stamped with the exact Affiliate Link that originated the click so per-Link performance is directly reportable.\n\n## Requirements\n\n* Keep/use `Sign_Up__c.Deal_Link__c` lookup to Affiliate Link.\n* Existing asynchronous SLC → Sign-Up processing resolves Affiliate Link by **Link External ID** captured by WAGR-49.\n* Link External ID is the canonical resolver; do not depend on Link Code being globally unique.\n* When resolved, stamp the Affiliate Link lookup on the resulting Sign-Up.\n* Blank/unresolvable/ambiguous identifiers leave the lookup blank and flag for review according to the existing SLC resolution-error pattern.\n* **Sign-Up creation is never blocked solely on Link resolution.**\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n1. Valid Link External ID resolves to exactly one Affiliate Link.\n2. Sign-Up stores the resolved Link lookup.\n3. Unknown identifier leaves the lookup blank and preserves Sign-Up creation.\n4. Reporting can group/count Sign-Ups directly by Affiliate Link.\n\n## Dependencies\n\n* WAGR-49 raw Link External ID intake.\n* WAGR-490 Affiliate Link External ID.\n* CMS/Strah click contract update.\n\n",
